] [17592186339510 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2bfe2f6a-4b05-5041-9be9-ec95d41ced84" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340405 #edb/ref 1080 "(2,0,1)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340405 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340405 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8e017315-e476-5fa0-8361-dc00652a6489" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340429 #edb/ref 1080 "(18,11,16)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340429 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340429 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "90fc5ea2-94e0-5824-91af-e274368bde07" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340633 #edb/ref 1080 "(8,-1,6)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340633 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340633 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a5f82de1-4dec-5d15-9285-344580d1aa1f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340706 #edb/ref 1080 "No intersection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340706 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340706 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ad64653c-387b-56c4-988a-77711f82ccae" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340726 #edb/ref 1080 "(-2,-5,4)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340726 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340726 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "af463bcf-e431-5d1e-a420-7660e1b98031" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341045 #edb/ref 1080 "(3,1,5)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341045 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341045 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d8153fa3-e604-533d-b56e-b26114f3d4d7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341326 #edb/ref 1080 "(-5,4,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341326 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341326 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f86bd550-c5e7-5c4a-ad94-8436818324a3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339365 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339510 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340633 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186340429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341479 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3769c405-5ffb-59ea-8180-d6fbf6837b56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340405 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340706 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340726 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186341045 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186341326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186341045 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341638 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9343b686-98f1-53b8-a0c6-e7d798a3b52a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341479 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1069 "q-73993" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:\\{\\begin{aligned}x=3-5t \\\\ y=2-3t \\\\ z=-2-6t\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,Π:5x-2y+4z-132=0.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8a17e320-306c-50fa-b84b-f8cbe958e629" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342127 #edb/ref 1074 "We can substitute the parametric expressions for $x,$ $y,$ and $z$ of the line into the equation of the plane immediately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-2y+4z-132 & =0 \\\\ 5(3-5t)-2(2-3t)+4(-2-6t) & =132 \\\\ 15-25t-4+6t-8-24t & =132 \\\\ -43t & =129 \\\\ t & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo get the position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$, we substitute $t=-3$ into the parametric equations of the line:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x=3-5(-3)=18 \\\\ y=2-3(-3)=11 \\\\ z=-2-6(-3)=16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is  $P(18,11,16).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341638 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1069 "q-74004" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨3,1,5⟩+w⟨-2,-5,4⟩,\\,Π:r=⟨-5,4,2⟩+s⟨0,3,1⟩+t⟨2,0,1⟩.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "156769fc-4325-56fe-a6f3-a488d1baa118" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342129 #edb/ref 1074 "From the equation of a plane in the parametric form $r=p+tv+sw$, we have that its normal vector is $n=v\\times w.$ In our case, the normal vectors to $Π$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =⟨0,3,1⟩\\times ⟨2,0,1⟩ \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =3i+2j-6k \\\\  & =⟨3,2,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane $Π$ in dot product form is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-6⟩ & =⟨-5,4,2⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-6⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-6⟩ & =-19.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨3,1,5⟩+w⟨-2,-5,4⟩$ into the equation of the plane in dot product form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-6⟩ & =-19 \\\\ ⟨3-2w,1-5w,5+4w⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-6⟩ & =-19 \\\\ 3(3-2w)+2(1-5w)-6(5+4w) & =-19 \\\\ 9-6w+2-10w-30-24w & =-19 \\\\ -40w & =0 \\\\ w & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to get the position vector $q$ of the intersection point $Q,$ we substitute $w=0$ into the equation of the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}q & =⟨3-2(0),1-5(0),5+4(0)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,1,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is $Q(3,1,5).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475444 #edb/ref 1080 "No intersection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475444 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475444 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "007d69dc-a2ca-580f-b0f7-74cbcfa1ebdd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475523 #edb/ref 1080 "(25,31,-6)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475523 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475523 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3a25e529-3954-5987-92eb-d533381cc44b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475562 #edb/ref 1080 "(-8,-13,5)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475562 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475562 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "52af092c-e727-5f18-8ff7-345347fe6d51" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475570 #edb/ref 1080 "(13,15,-2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475570 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475570 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "572842f6-cb5d-5a22-b2c9-50266f22eb6a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475823 #edb/ref 1080 "(-14,-21,7)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475823 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475823 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fca47535-789f-5b0b-98b2-271a04ca1b25" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475444 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475570 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475823 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475895 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592