 line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}q & =⟨1+3(8),-1+4(8),2-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨25,31,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is $Q(25,31,-6).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186484300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186484313 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186484327 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186484330 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186484337 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1045 "The Intersection Between a Line and a Plane" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186484337 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050148 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483561 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "77955475-06cd-58a4-a89c-cfc9a4ad253a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483621 #edb/ref 1080 "(-16,-16,13)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483621 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483621 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "20fc86f8-0368-54eb-a3e0-3cf6b0379332" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483624 #edb/ref 1080 "(24,-11,11)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483624 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483624 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2143e54b-67d5-5002-957a-3bf88c230ca4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483630 #edb/ref 1080 "No intersection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483630 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483630 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "257b548a-b52d-5b2d-8a2f-57d74b50d39c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483813 #edb/ref 1080 "(11,-13,11)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483813 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483813 #edb/re